flowchart LR
    A([onFlush / final flush]) --> B{messageBuffer has text?}
    B -->|no| END([return])
    B -->|yes| C{willBurst && >=4 words?}
    C -->|no| D[send as single message]
    D --> END
    C -->|yes| E[split into 2-3 fragments at word boundaries]
    E --> F[send fragment 1 with reply style]
    F --> G[setTimeout burst_delay]
    G --> H[send fragment 2 without reply]
    H --> I{3 fragments?}
    I -->|yes| J[setTimeout burst_delay]
    J --> K[send fragment 3]
    I -->|no| END
    K --> END
